ementtiming="system-gallery-block-grid" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/logo01-color-with-name-tag-840x745.jpg">\n</img></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="slide">\n<div class="margin-wrapper">\n<a aria-label="" class="image-slide-anchor content-fit" href="http://www.wscta.org" target="_blank">\n<noscript><img alt="WSCTA LOGO1.png" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/wscta-logo1.png"/></noscript><img alt="WSCTA LOGO1.png" class="thumb-image" elementtiming="system-gallery-block-grid" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/wscta-logo1.png">\n</img></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div></div></div></div></div>', 'Home', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'home-legacy', '', '', '2026-05-09 16:14:25', '2026-05-09 16:14:25', '', 0, 'https://example.local/?post_type=page&amp;p=1056', 0, 'page', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES (1057, 1, '2026-05-09 16:14:25', '2026-05-09 16:14:25', '<div><div><div><div>\n<div>\n<p>Fill out the form below and we\'ll get back to you as soon as we can.</p>\n</div>\n</div></div></div><div><div class="float float-right"><div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>Box Office Hours:</strong></p><p>Tuesday - Friday 1pm to 6pm and 1.5 hours prior to all public performances</p>\n</div>\n</div></div><div><div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>Tacoma Little Theatre<br/></strong>210 North I St<br/>Tacoma, WA 98403<br/>(253) 272-2281</p><p>Federal ID #91-0485763</p>\n</div>\n</div></div><div><div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>TRANSPORTATION &amp; PARKING<br/></strong>Buses<br/>Tacoma Little Theatre is located walking distance from Route 11 &amp; Route 16 on the Pierce Transit System. (Stop ID: 1686)</p><p>Parking<br/>Tacoma Little Theatre has limited parking available for Season Ticket Holders and Donors.  For more information about this parking agreement, please contact the Box Office. </p><p>For general parking, we recommend that you arrive 30 minutes before curtain to find parking. Yakima Avenue, 2nd, I, and J streets are popular choices.  </p><p>For ADA parking, we have one spot in front of the building on I Street.  If you contact us in advance, we can also hold a spot in the 7-11 parking lot for you.</p><p>Please note: The 7-11 parking lot has THREE marked spots for TLT patrons.  Do not park in any other 7-11 parking spot.  Also, do not park in any of the private apartment lots.  They will tow your vehicle.</p><p>Bicycles<br/>Tacoma LIttle Theatre has a bike rack located in front of the main building. </p>\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div>', 'Contact & Transportation', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'contact', '', '', '2026-05-09 16:14:25', '2026-05-09 16:14:25', '', 0, 'https://example.local/?post_type=page&amp;p=1057', 0, 'page', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES (1058, 1, '2026-05-09 16:14:25', '2026-05-09 16:14:25', '<div class="sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12" data-type="page" data-updated-on="1773610605558" id="page-56328a64e4b01128298ec41f"><div><div><div><div>\n<div>\n<p>Each season TLT presents its "Off the Shelf" series.  We know that there is a tremendous amount of wonderful theatre that deserves to be heard but sometimes just doesn’t get an opportunity. With “Off the Shelf”, local directors and actors will be bringing some scripts to life that we hope you will find entertaining, challenging and educational to our stage. We hope that you’ll sit back and enjoy an evening of theatre. You never know, you might see one of these shows on our mainstage in the future.</p><p>We are excited to bring back our “Off the Shelf” series for 2025-2026.  Titles will be announced shortly along with ticketing information.</p><p><span><strong><em>Events will take place in December, March, April June, and July</em></strong></span></p>\n</div>\n</div></div><div><div>\n<div class="layout-caption-below design-layout-inline combination-animation-none individual-animation-none individual-text-animation-none">\n<figure class="intrinsic">\n<div>\n<div class="has-aspect-ratio">\n<img alt="" decoding="async" elementtiming="system-image-block" height="5400" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 100vw, 100vw" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/2526-chirstmas-carol-2.jpg" width="3600"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</figure>\n</div>\n</div></div><div><div>\n<div class="layout-caption-below design-layout-inline combination-animation-none individual-animation-none individual-text