<div class="summary-metadata summary-metadata--primary">\n<!-- Timestamp -->\n<time class="summary-metadata-item summary-metadata-item--date" datetime="2024-06-11">Jun 11, 2024</time>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class="summary-title">\n<a class="summary-title-link" href="/blog/20252026/productionteam">NOW HIRING-PRODUCTION TEAM MEMBERS FOR 2026-2027</a></div>\n<div class="summary-metadata-container summary-metadata-container--below-title">\n<div class="summary-metadata summary-metadata--primary">\n<!-- Timestamp -->\n<time class="summary-metadata-item summary-metadata-item--date" datetime="2024-06-11">Jun 11, 2024</time>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class="summary-excerpt summary-excerpt-only"><p>TLT is currently accepting applications for production team members for 2026-2027!</p></div>\n<div class="summary-metadata-container summary-metadata-container--below-content">\n<div class="summary-metadata summary-metadata--primary">\n<!-- Timestamp -->\n<time class="summary-metadata-item summary-metadata-item--date" datetime="2024-06-11">Jun 11, 2024</time>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>', 'Job Openings', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'job-openings', '', '', '2026-05-09 16:14:25', '2026-05-09 16:14:25', '', 0, 'https://example.local/?post_type=page&amp;p=1060', 0, 'page', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES (1061, 1, '2026-05-09 16:14:25', '2026-05-09 16:14:25', '<div class="sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12" data-type="page" data-updated-on="1662613674827" id="page-5a652c9ce4966ba2421f8570"><div><div><div><div>\n<div>\n<p>A unique club that offers year-round education dedicated to middle and high school students, ages 13-19. Fall, winter, and spring will offer a variety of classes for students to take or meaningful workshop experiences. Students will have opportunities to focus on their audition skills to help prepare for school auditions and any community auditions they are working on, as well as work on their improv skills. These things help build confidence and improve success in theatre arts. </p>\n</div>\n</div></div><div class="float float-right"><div>\n<div class="layout-caption-hidden design-layout-inline combination-animation-none individual-animation-none individual-text-animation-none">\n<figure class="intrinsic">\n<div>\n<div class="has-aspect-ratio">\n<img alt="" decoding="async" elementtiming="system-image-block" height="311" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 100vw, 100vw" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/unnamed.jpg" width="202"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</figure>\n</div>\n</div></div><div><div>\n<div>\n<ul><li><p>Workshops and master classes will help develop skill in all areas of theater. In the past, workshops have included performance, direction, design, stage management, play writing, and program development.</p></li><li><p>Behind-the-scenes events will introduce students to theater performers and creative teams, to help deepen their understanding of how shows are produced.</p></li><li><p>Students will work together to create performances especially suited for teenagers.</p></li><li><p>Special activities will offer students opportunities to attend performances and volunteer at TLT and other local schools and theaters.</p></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div><div><div>\n<div>\n<p>For more information email us at clubtlt@tacomalittletheatre.com, or education@tacomalittletheatre.com.</p>\n</div>\n</div></div><div><div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<a href="/current-classes">CURRENT CLASSES</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div><div class="gallery-block"><div>\n<div class="block-animation-none clear">\n<div>\n<noscript><img alt="SAM_2018.JPG" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/sam-2018.jpg"/></noscript><img alt="SAM_2018.JPG" class="thumb-image" elementtiming="system-gallery-block-slider" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/sam-2018.jpg"/>\n<noscript><img alt="1617LikeYouLikeIt.jpg" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/1617likeyoulikeit.jpg"/></noscript><img alt="1617LikeYouLikeIt.jpg" class="thumb-image" elementtiming="system-gallery-block-slider" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/1617likeyoulikeit.jpg"/>\n<noscript><img alt="DSC_0415.jpg" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/dsc-0415.jpg"/></noscript><img alt="DSC_0415.jpg" class="thumb-image" elementtiming="system-gallery-block-slider" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/dsc-0415.jpg"/>\n<noscript><img alt="SAM_2102.JPG" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/sam-2102.jpg"/></noscript><img alt="SAM_2102.JPG" class="thumb-image" elementtiming="system-gallery-block-slider" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/sam-2102.jpg"/>\n<noscript><img alt="SAM_2116.JPG" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/sam-2116.jpg"/></noscript><img alt="SAM_2116.JPG" class="thumb-image" elementtiming="system-gallery-block-slider" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/sam-2116.jpg"/>\n<noscript><img alt="DSC_0474.jpg" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/dsc-0474.jpg"/></noscript><img alt="DSC_0474.jpg" class="thumb-image" elementtiming="system-gallery-block-slider" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/dsc-0474.jpg"/>\n<noscript><img alt="SAM_2231.JPG" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/sam-2231.jpg"/></noscript><img alt="SAM_2231.JPG" class="thumb-image" elementtiming="system-gallery-block-slider" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/sam-2231.jpg"/>\n<noscript><img alt="DSC_0489.jpg" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/dsc-0489.jpg"/></noscript><img alt="DSC_0489.jpg" class="thumb-image" elementtiming="system-gallery-block-slider" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/dsc-0489.jpg"/>\n<noscript><img alt="SAM_2437.JPG" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/sam-2437.jpg"/></noscript><img alt="SAM_2437.JPG" class="thumb-image" elementtiming="system-gallery-block-slider" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/sam-2437.jpg"/>\n<noscript><img alt="DSC_0505.jpg" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/dsc-0505.jpg"/></noscript><img alt="DSC_0505.jpg" class="thumb-image" elementtiming="system-gallery-block-slider" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/dsc-0505.jpg"/>\n<noscript><img alt="1617IHateShakespeareposter.jpg" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/1617ihateshakespeareposter.jpg"/></noscript><img alt="1617IHateShakespeareposter.jpg" class="thumb-image" elementtiming="system-gallery-block-slider" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/1617ihateshakespeareposter.jpg"/>\n<noscript><img alt="DSC_0547.jpg" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/dsc-0547.jpg"/></noscript><img alt="DSC_0547.jpg" class="thumb-image" elementtiming="system-gallery-block-slider" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/dsc-0547.jpg"/>\n<noscript><img alt="DSC_0576.jpg" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/dsc-0576.jpg"/></noscript><img alt="DSC_0576.jpg" class="thumb-image" elementtiming="system-gallery-block-slider" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/dsc-0576.jpg"/>\n<noscript><img alt="DSC_0667.jpg" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/dsc-0667.jpg"/></noscript><img alt="DSC_0667.jpg" class="thumb-image" elementtiming="system-gallery-block-slider" src="/wp-content/uploads/migrated/dsc-0667.jpg"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>', 'ClubTLT', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'clubtlt', '', '', '2026-05-09 16:14:25', '2026-05-09 16:14:25', '', 0, 'https://example.local/?post_type=page&amp;p=1061', 0, 'page', '', 0);
