bligation and civic duty. George’s guardian angel must descend on Christmas Eve to save him from de', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'its-a-wonderful-life', '', '', '2026-05-09 16:14:31', '2026-05-09 16:14:31', '', 0, 'https://example.local/?post_type=tlt_show&amp;p=1148', 0, 'tlt_show', '', 0);
