s out to be an evening of both funny and spellbinding stories. When the final tale take', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'weir', '', '', '2026-05-09 16:14:31', '2026-05-09 16:14:31', '', 0, 'https://example.local/?post_type=tlt_show&amp;p=1149', 0, 'tlt_show', '', 0);
